  "title": "BlackLine Announces Date for First Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, April 21, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BlackLine, Inc. (Nasdaq: BL) announced today that it will release financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026 after market close on Tuesday, May 5, 2026 followed by a conference call hosted by management at 2:00 p.m. PT / 5:00 p.m.",
